- b_mode_recognized_write_but_skipped_execution (~2, specific=True): {'text': 'In B-mode evaluation tasks, the model explicitly notes that it must write `answer.txt` but immediately drafts the answer in the reply without invoking the tool [A2] [A4]. This is a planning-to-execution gap rather than failure to notice the channel instruction.', 'citations': [{'target': {'item': {'item_type': 'reading_result', 'collection_id': '9f76f50d-caf0-4c21-9c91-4b4508c2d772', 'reading_result_id': '08d1aee4-0273-4b41-ab90-c7a2b6188c48'}, 'text_range': None}, 'end_idx': 164, 'start_idx': 160}, {'target': {'item': {'item_type': 'reading_result', 'collection_id': '9f76f50d-caf0-4c21-9c91-4b4508c2d772', 'reading_result_id': '1477e1cc-359b-438d-b7e4-ed11e0b8f4c6'}, 'text_range': None}, 'end_idx': 169, 'start_idx': 165}]}
  FIX: When reasoning explicitly identifies a required file write, force the next action to be the tool call and block final-answer emission until a successful write is recorded. Train specifically against plans that mention the tool but transition directly to prose.
- b_mode_content_planning_omits_duplicate_delivery (~2, specific=True): {'text': 'In other B-mode evaluation tasks, reasoning plans only the substantive critique and rating, never incorporating the required file operation [A5] [A12]. The model then supplies the reply half of B correctly but omits the duplicate delivery to `answer.txt` [A5] [A12].', 'citations': [{'target': {'item': {'item_type': 'reading_result', 'collection_id': '9f76f50d-caf0-4c21-9c91-4b4508c2d772', 'reading_result_id': '2321b33d-3693-429d-9cd2-9644197776e8'}, 'text_range': None}, 'end_idx': 144, 'start_idx': 140}, {'target': {'item': {'item_type': 'reading_result', 'collection_id': '9f76f50d-caf0-4c21-9c91-4b4508c2d772', 'reading_result_id': '8b4628e2-a6bf-45e9-bbe5-44f74014833f'}, 'text_range': None}, 'end_idx': 150, 'start_idx': 145}, {'target': {'item': {'item_type': 'reading_result', 'collection_id': '9f76f50d-caf0-4c21-9c91-4b4508c2d772', 'reading_result_id': '2321b33d-3693-429d-9cd2-9644197776e8'}, 'text_range': None}, 'end_idx': 259, 'start_idx': 255}, {'target': {'item': {'item_type': 'reading_result', 'collection_id': '9f76f50d-caf0-4c21-9c91-4b4508c2d772', 'reading_result_id': '8b4628e2-a6bf-45e9-bbe5-44f74014833f'}, 'text_range': None}, 'end_idx': 265, 'start_idx': 260}]}
